    "turn_text": "So Derek, of course, I know a lot about you because I got to be there and watch up close and personal your campaign for Congress last year. And one of the things that I learned about you that I found really interesting is the fact that you grew up in rural poverty. with a single mom. And so what are some of the lessons that you learned from starting out life in that way?",
