    "turn_text": "you win every fight you don't get into. And how you do that without our victorious without engaging in an actual battle is you get the person so demoralized or discouraged, they won't fight back. And if you're really good at it, which the left is fantastic at this, you get them so demoralized, they won't even defend themselves. So we are falling, some of our people are falling into that trap. right into the left trap. They're saying, we can't win. I'm out. That's not true. It's fundamentally not true. And I will give you an example. Could you anyone here imagine AOC saying, ask not what your country can do for you, but ask what you can do for your country?",
